        "id": 1000205
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-10-19T19:57:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sounds about right. I think it would be better to replace the BUG_ON with a binder_user_error than to just remove it. It may also be possible to not add a list, but instead add something like a thread-\u003etodo_should_wake flag instead.",
      "parentUuid": "6ecff026_58b19e4a",
      "revId": "34c3493e45451d505d05c52266e946fbb592c001",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
